## Out of Scope

| Feature | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| Position sizing, target weights, buy/sell recommendations | César forms his own views |
| Politicians' trading disclosures | Excluded by César |
| Portfolio data on the market dashboard | Dashboard is market only |
| Cloud-hosted LSEG jobs | Cloud cannot reach Workspace on `localhost` |
| Login, multi-user, remote or mobile access | Excel downloads are César only, local |
| Streaming real-time prices | Daily LSEG close plus a labeled intraday yfinance layer is enough; streaming adds cost and a second truth |
| LLM-written numbers, rewritten headlines, LLM ranking | Numbers from an LLM have cost wrong results before |
| `edgartools` for 13F numbers | Open silent 1000x units bug; can break the lseg-data pin |
| `claude --bare` with API key | César chose the Pro subscription |
| Universe-wide 13F heat maps, "follow this fund" signals | Scope is the seed list; no trading signals |
| In-browser deck editing, native PowerPoint charts | Decks are generated; PNG charts from the design system |
| Unlicensed LSEG content (WSJ, Bloomberg, Dow Jones, Barron's, `.DJI`, `.N225`, `.VXN`, `.SKEW`, SOFR futures, `ECON_RLDT`) | Verified not in the license |

